<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kuhlman EPS view upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kuhlman EPS view upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said analyst Walt Kirchberger raised his earnings estimate for Kuhlman Corp to $1.70 per share from $1.40 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- shares gained one to 19-1/4.</p>
</text>
